Output demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set Width 1500
Set Height 800
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 24
Set Margin 20
Set MarginFill "#181825"
Set BorderRadius 12
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Framerate 15

Hide
Type "env -u NO_COLOR FORCE_COLOR=1 uv run --locked python scripts/demo.py"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Tab
Right
Sleep 2s
Right
Sleep 2s
Right
Sleep 2s
